# Real grading run output. Ephemeral, often large (full model responses), and
# regenerated on every run — never committed.
#
# The one deliberate exception is each workflow's `example-run/`, which is a
# real run kept in-tree as reference documentation for the artifact shapes.
# It lives outside `.runs/` precisely so this rule cannot swallow it.
.runs/

# Bytecode from loading a validate hook / adapter by file path.
__pycache__/
